Agastya welcomes weary Rāma party --- Agastya praises faithful Sītā above fickle women --- Rāma asks for watered forested dwelling site --- Agastya directs Rāma to Pañcavaṭī two yōjanas away --- Agastya describes route and Gōdāvarī delights --- Agastya says Rāma will protect ascetics there --- Rāma takes leave and leaves for Pañcavaṭī